    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dragon Defense</strong> is an action-packed, wave-based defense strategy game where you must build, craft, and protect your island from relentless monster invasions. Use blueprints to create tools, grow crops, and fortify your defenses while relying on animals to aid in your survival. Face increasingly difficult waves of enemies determined to destroy your land, steal your animals, and take you down. Can you outlast the onslaught and keep your island thriving?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfdd <strong>Build &amp; Defend</strong> \u2013 Grow crops, raise animals, and construct defenses to protect your island.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0a <strong>Wave-Based Combat</strong> \u2013 Survive increasingly difficult enemy waves that test your strategy and endurance.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udee0 <strong>Blueprint Crafting</strong> \u2013 Unlock and use blueprints to create tools, weapons, and defensive structures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc09 <strong>Animal Allies</strong> \u2013 Utilize animals to assist with farming, defense, and resource gathering.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694 <strong>Survive Monster Raids</strong> \u2013 Battle creatures that attack, destroy crops, and capture your animals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 <strong>Power-Ups &amp; Leveling</strong> \u2013 Collect power-ups, upgrade your skills, and adapt your strategy to stay ahead.</p></li></ul>",
